  "excerpt": "QEI invites early career optometrists to an exciting evening of retina education.",
  "body_html": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Collect CPD points through interactive learning at QEI’s</h3>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #1b75bc;\"><strong>OPTOMETRY QUIZ &amp; TRIVIA NIGHT</strong></span></h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Tuesday 24th March 2026</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><img alt=\"Optometry Australia CPD points awarded\" class=\"wpa-warning wpa-image-missing-alt aligncenter wp-image-6559 size-medium\" data-warning=\"Missing alt text\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"300\" sizes=\"(max-width: 175px) 100vw, 175px\" src=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2026/02/5i-4.75T-175x300.jpg\" srcset=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2026/02/5i-4.75T-175x300.jpg 175w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2026/02/5i-4.75T.jpg 375w\" width=\"175\"/></div>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">This event will commence with presentations by our ophthalmologists on topics including medical retina, corneal and refractive diseases, glaucoma, optic nerve conditions and eyelid lumps and bumps. Attendees will then form teams to compete for prizes by answering a series of multiple-choice questions. All teams will include a QEI ophthalmologist who will guide them in their quest for first place.</p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><img alt=\"Sign saying 'sorry registration closed'\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-6221\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"431\" id=\"longdesc-return-6221\" longdesc=\"https://qei.org.au?longdesc=6221&amp;referrer=6465\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" src=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Registration-closed.png\" srcset=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Registration-closed.png 500w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Registration-closed-300x259.png 300w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Registration-closed-348x300.png 348w\" tabindex=\"-1\" width=\"500\"/></div>\n<p> </p>",
  "details_html": "<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Tuesday, 24th March 2026</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">6:00 pm – 8:30 pm</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Rooftop<br/>\nQueensland Eye Institute<br/>\n87 Ipswich Rd<br/>\nWoolloongabba</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/RuVkJp4Nz46vgF6j9\">View map</a></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">🍽️Dinner, drinks and dessert provided</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">🏆Awesome prizes to be won</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">🚗Parking available on-site (enter via Henry Street)</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Numbers are strictly limited and registration is essential to secure your place.</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><a href=\"https://aus01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fforms.cloud.microsoft%2Fr%2FBVm3jhBJwR&amp;data=05%7C02%7CAngela.Bensted%40qei.org.au%7Cf1987a4a6b19464ad7eb08de6dc38b71%7Cc8e2173d436c4e7db7daae62b07b1cdf%7C0%7C0%7C639068883826665647%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=ZYKXEx1aLWv18JAhaEALVmv4XCOXwGYXQxDK6qIT4cU%3D&amp;reserved=0\"><img alt=\"Call to action button to register for event\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-6468\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"64\" src=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2026/02/CTA-button-2.png\" width=\"214\"/></a></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">All enquiries to Tina Huynh at <a href=\"mailto:education@qei.org.au\">education@qei.org.au</a></p>",
